<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistani rupee closing rates in kerb market.</title>
<headline>Pakistani rupee closing rates in kerb market.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Friday's spot rupee rates in kerb market from Khanani &amp; Kalia Int'l (Pvt) Ltd:</p>
<p>				Buying rate	 Selling rate</p>
<p>    U.S. dollar	   41.35		 41.45</p>
<p>    Pound sterling	66.75		 66.85</p>
<p>    Deutsche mark	 23.90		 23.95</p>
<p>    Japanese yen	   0.325		 0.327</p>
<p>    Saudi riyal	   11.00		 11.02</p>
<p>    UAE dirham	    11.25		 11.27</p>
<p>    Indian rupee	   1.07		  1.09</p>
<p>    F.E.B.C.		 2.80 pct	    3.00 pct</p>
</text>
